// Panel: "Power Over Time (1-min avg)"  - Time series, Format as: Table.  OWNER: Part 3
// Needs the Grafana transformation "Partition by values" on field "appliance"
// to split the long-format rows into one line per appliance.
Power1m
| where $__timeFilter(ts)
| project ts, appliance, avg_w
| order by ts asc
